{"key":"map/gz22d1","relations":[{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/vor","title":"Crooked","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/gerald","title":"Geraldine","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/mthief","title":"Trickster","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"inhabitant","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone24%20bat","title":"Black bat (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone24%20succubblue","title":"Grey harpy (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone23%20elemental%20ice","title":"Ice elemental (variant 2)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone24%20evileye","title":"Red evil eye (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone24%20octopus","title":"Young black wormhead (variant 1)","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"exit","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz22k","title":"Mining district","variant":""}],"title":"Connected locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Abandoned mines</h1><p>Mining stopped when the workers broke into wormface dwellings. The masters of the underground do not welcome intruders.</p><h2>The Beastmasters and the empty caravan</h2><p>At the Beastmasters’ settlement, <a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Crooked</a> accuses Kir and Kel of being spies. <a href=\"wiki://character/gerald\">Geraldine</a> agrees to test them. Their attempt to obtain a gold nugget from a caravan finds an empty chest, making their return dangerous. <a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Trickster</a> reasons that genuine thieves would not come back empty-handed, and Geraldine accepts them. Advice from Trickster, also passed on by Sver if Kir consults him, about an ice elemental in the abandoned mines provides something to offer Yam-Akara. His work and the governor’s permit requirements then draw the travellers into further dealings with the court. The missing nugget will matter again when the apparent caravan failure becomes evidence of a separate theft. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals, event scripts and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/gerald\">Geraldine</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Crooked</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_212)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Trickster</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/gerald\">Geraldine</a> (briefing brief_215)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/trapper\">Sver the Trapper</a> (briefing brief_218)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/kmage\">Yam-Akara</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_221)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/his\">His</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_245a)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/gerald\">Geraldine</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Trickster</a> (briefing brief_214)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Trickster</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_217)</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/kmage\">Yam-Akara</a> (briefing brief_219)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/ingos\">Ingos</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz22k\">Mining district</a></td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Rela